ars": 1103, "code_blocks": 1, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "ba78d5b7-502f-4613-a810-06507c61934e", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790132716.6407526, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "model_editable_context", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "82257898-0e83-41cc-b5e5-466c5055923c", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790132720.613778, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "45eaf8c9-ff9a-4c11-8161-d2a5e35724b1", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790132812.495157, "updated_at": 1790132824.651723, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["image_asset_pointer", "text"], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": ["image_asset_pointer", "text"]}, {"message_id": "d036976b-59b4-4539-a157-2d40f5400d9b", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790132813.893456, "updated_at": 1790132824.340538, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Yep — **tap the first one: `Run Script`**.\n\nThat `{ }` action is the one we want here. Once you add it, it should expose fields where you can select the Scriptable script and pass input.\n\nThen configure it like this:\n\n1. Tap **Run Script**\n2. For **Script**, choose `capture`\n3. For the input/parameter field, feed it the **Text** block you already built:\n   ```text\n   action_button\n   [Dictated Text]\n   ```\n4. Turn **Show When Run** off if that option appears.\n\nIf after tapping **Run Script** it does **not** give you a way to choose your `capture` Scriptable script, back out and search specifically for **`Scriptable`** instead of “Run script.” But from this screen, the first `Run Script` is the correct one to try.", "text_chars": 722, "code_blocks": 1, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "40c94767-47d8-4e5e-ac08-0c8b83ea7b95", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790132819.435203, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "reasoning_recap", "part_kinds": [], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "4c3bb1e9-1873-4204-8dc0-0e47878a03b1", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790132888.692882, "updated_at": 1790132904.625041, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["image_asset_pointer", "text"], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": ["image_asset_pointer", "text"]}, {"message_id": "483348fc-fc8c-4ce0-b6bd-6f451365e121", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790132890.322303, "updated_at": 1790132904.303576, "status": "