e correct wiring.", "text_chars": 525, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "50824499-4035-4aad-8fb1-50c0531e136d", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790133264.135462, "updated_at": 1790133281.535088, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "multimodal_text", "part_kinds": ["image_asset_pointer", "text"], "text": "I hate this fucking shit with Siri. Look. I put the text box...", "text_chars": 63, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": ["image_asset_pointer"]}, {"message_id": "352dcf5e-6f95-49c9-9501-541b76e6618e", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790133265.396103, "updated_at": 1790133280.404077, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Yep — I see it. **You’re in the right place now.**\n\nAt the bottom variable picker, choose the **yellow `Text` variable**. That is the combined block we want:\n\n`action_button`\n+\n`Dictated Text`\n\nSo for the `Run GCE_Capture with Parameter` action:\n\n1. Tap **Parameter**.\n2. Tap the yellow **Text** variable you can see in the picker.\n3. It should replace `Parameter` with a yellow/blue token representing that Text block.\n\nIgnore the red Siri error for the moment. That’s a **separate execution-context issue** from the parameter wiring.\n\nRight now, just wire **Text → Parameter**.\n\nOnce that’s done, send me the next screenshot and we’ll deal with the Siri/dictation problem separately.", "text_chars": 685, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "02ba4d07-5969-4588-b570-45f