rk / Done** on the keyboard sheet if it appears.\n4. The gray row should change into a **colored variable token**, not stay as plain gray `Text`.\n\nAlso, flip **Show When Run** to **off** while you’re here.\n\nThe red Siri error is still separate. Ignore that for the moment.\n\nYour success condition on this screen is simple:\n\n> Under **Texts**, the row should no longer say plain gray `Text`; it should display the selected Text variable as a colored pill/token.\n\nOnce that changes, the parameter wiring is actually complete.", "text_chars": 959, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "d9dd4b12-ece8-4a33-b5de-a1ca19cf49be", "role": "user", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790133513.339927, "updated_at": 1790133534.369773, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "Fucking nope. Nope nope nope nope nope. Every time I do it, there's no checkbox.", "text_chars": 80, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": null, "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": []}, {"message_id": "82768db3-5e42-4369-87a2-a18d6198c541", "role": "assistant", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790133514.600177, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 1, "recipient": "web.run", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "", "text_chars": 0, "code_blocks": 0, "links": [], "citations": [], "path_references": [], "model_slug": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "has_voice_metadata": false, "unextractable_part_kinds": ["text"]}, {"message_id": "027d83c9-b1a0-4ad7-b2b1-15dfbeda63b1", "role": "system", "role_name": null, "created_at": 1790133515.5400712, "updated_at": null, "status": "finished_successfully", "weight": 0, "recipient": "all", "content_type": "text", "part_kinds": ["text"], "text": "",